{number: 158}
{title: Freely, Freely}
{key: F}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[F] God forgave my sin in Jesus' [Bb] name,
I've been [F] born again in Jesus' [C7] name;
And in [F] Jesus' name I come to [Bb] you
To [F] share His [C7] love as He told me [F] to.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
He said, [F] "Freely, freely you have re-[Bb] ceived,
[F] Freely, freely [C7] give;
Go in My [F] name, and because you be-[Bb] lieve,
[F] Others will [C7] know that I [F] live."
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
All [F] pow'r is giv'n in Jesus' [Bb] name,
In earth [F] and heav'n in Jesus' [C7] name;
And in [F] Jesus' name I come to [Bb] you
To [F] share His [C7] pow'r as He told me [F] to.
{end_of_verse}
